    "AdsODAXObjectiveStrings names CampaignGroup LINK_CLICKS Traffic; this does not select an Ad Set optimization goal.",
    "AdsODAXUtils.isODAXTrafficCampaignGroup recognizes exactly is_odax_campaign_group === true and CampaignGroup objective LINK_CLICKS.",
    "AdsEditorUnsupportedReasonUtils rejects OUTCOME_TRAFFIC while allowing LINK_CLICKS in the Campaign and Ad Set editor checks.",
    "AdsCampaignGroupRecordAccessors exposes objective and is_odax_campaign_group through the writable basicFieldAccessorFactory, whose .set writes the named field via setIn.",
    "AdsLiveCreationDataManager.__createCampaignGroup writes objective:n.objective and is_odax_campaign_group:n.isODAXCampaignGroup||null into the same Campaign draft passed to AdsDraftFragmentUtils.createFragment. This confirms the field role in actual creation, separately from editor display/read models.",
    "AdsCampaignGroupDraftFragmentsApplyChangesReducerPlugin merges changed CampaignGroup records into the draft; AdsDraftFragmentDataManager.getAPIParams and create pass typed values through to addraft_fragments without translating objectives.",
    "This establishes a source-backed private editor-record representation. No current-account response or real editor acceptance is claimed; EDITOR_UNVERIFIED remains required."
  ],
